# What the docs job builds the documentation with (ci.yml): the same list as Read the Docs
# is given, which does not pin it.
-r ../../docs/source/requirements.txt
# Sphinx 9.2 needs Python 3.13, and this lock covers 3.12 and up (the docs job of ci.yml runs on
# 3.12): without a bound, uv gives Sphinx one version for 3.12 and another for 3.13 and up, and a
# lock has to pin each package once (see dependabot.yml). Remove it when the lock is compiled for
# Python 3.13 or later: test_the_limits_on_sphinx_9_2_match_the_python_of_the_docs_lock says when.
sphinx<9.2
